OL,3,GNEWSABanned driver in stolen Maserati
OL,4,Awho killed pensioner jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disqualified driver who caused the
OL,7,Fdeath of a great-grandfather after
OL,8,Fcrashing into his garden in a stolen
OL,9,FMaserati sports car has been jailed for
OL,10,F13-and-a-half years.
OL,12,FFraser Garden killed 74-year-old John
OL,13,FBell, also known as Jack, in Broughty
OL,14,FFerry, near Dundee, when the crash
OL,15,Fhappened in April.
OL,17,FThe High Court in Edinburgh was told
OL,18,FGarden, who had 90 previous convictions
OL,19,Fand two previous lifetime driving bans,
OL,20,Fhad taken cocaine and was driving at
OL,21,Falmost three times the speed limit.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
